# Ocean Translator

> Part of [LoPAS Open Translator Core](../LoPAS-Open-Translator-Core)

Translates ocean and weather data into common state space.

---

## Data Sources

| Source | Data | Update |
|--------|------|--------|
| CMEMS | Wave height, period, direction, current speed | 3–6h |
| NOAA GFS | Wind speed, direction, gust | 6h |
| Open-Meteo Marine API | Wind, wave, solar radiation | 1h |

---

## Schema

```yaml
meta:
  translator: ocean-translator
  version: 0.1.0
  timestamp:
  lag_seconds:
  coverage_gap:
  confidence:

coordinate:
  lat:
  lon:
  timestamp:

sources:
  - provider: CMEMS
    update_interval: 10800
  - provider: NOAA_GFS
    update_interval: 21600
  - provider: Open-Meteo
    update_interval: 3600

observation:
  wave_height_m:
  wave_period_s:
  wave_direction_deg:
  wind_speed_ms:
  wind_direction_deg:
  wind_gust_ms:
  current_speed_ms:
  current_direction_deg:
  solar_radiation_wm2:

derived:
  navigation_risk:      # 0.0–1.0
  power_potential:      # LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH
  escape_cost:          # relative movement energy cost
  current_assisted:     # true/false — can current aid movement?

state:
  status:               # SAFE | CAUTION | WARNING | CRITICAL
  risk_score:           # 0.0–1.0
  trend:                # IMPROVING | STABLE | DEGRADING | UNKNOWN

lopas:
  RAR:    # prediction vs actual sea state
  SCI:    # storm / hazard level
  E_esc:  # escape energy (movement cost)
  CDI:    # vessel/node distribution
  OSI:    # over-reliance on stale forecast

action:
  recommendation:       # HOLD | MONITOR | PREPARE | MOVE
  confidence:
```

---

## State Thresholds

| risk_score | status | action |
|-----------|--------|--------|
| 0.80–1.00 | SAFE | HOLD |
| 0.50–0.79 | CAUTION | MONITOR |
| 0.20–0.49 | WARNING | PREPARE |
| 0.00–0.19 | CRITICAL | MOVE |

